  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      165.03,
      478.74,
      178.5
    ],
    "text": "1. by the repeal of regulation 3 thereof and the substitution therefor of the following regulation :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      189.03,
      547.29,
      202.5
    ],
    "text": "''3. The fee payable under Section 6 of the Act, in respect of the application for a licence shall be as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      169.33,
      230.68,
      435.24,
      244.15
    ],
    "text": "(a)a licence to import fertilizer-Rs.150,000.00",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      168.76,
      250.34,
      435.23,
      275.81
    ],
    "text": "(b)a licence to manufacture inorganic fertilizer-Rs.150,000.00",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
